<title>USA: Trade estimates for USDA weekly grain export sales.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for USDA weekly grain export sales.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the U.S.</p>
<p>Department of Agriculture's weekly net export sales were as</p>
<p>follows (in tonnes). The report is slated for release at 0830</p>
<p>EST on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Commodity	  Estimate Range</p>
<p>    Corn	     650,000 to 1,000,000</p>
<p>    Wheat	    200,000 to 300,000</p>
<p>    Soybeans	 300,000 to 400,000</p>
<p>    Soyoil	     5,000 to 10,000</p>
<p>    Soymeal	   40,000 to 60,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
